 check "name resolution (host resolver)" '^localhost=1 127\.0\.0\.1$' '^invalid=0$' '^reverse=1 ' "^hostname=$(hostname)\$" '^hostid=[0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+$' -- \
